OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'brutally' attacked women on
OL,4,Ahis birthday
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who "brutally" subjected two
OL,7,Fwomen to a 15-minute long attack on his
OL,8,Fbirthday has been jailed for six years
OL,9,Fand nine months.
OL,11,FGary Burton, 38, rained kicks and
OL,12,Fpunches on his then-partner and
OL,13,Fex-girlfriend in the foyer of his
OL,14,FGateshead flat block after they had
OL,15,Fbeen drinking and taking drugs
OL,16,Ftogether, Newcastle Crown Court heard.
OL,18,FOne of the women was found outside
OL,19,Fcovered in blood and screaming, the
OL,20,Fcourt heard, with judge Robert Spragg
OL,21,Fsaying the "vicious and sustained"
OL,22,Fattack involved "gratuitous violence".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
